{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723640/extras/1280x720.png?t=1756402310\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENGAGING STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of <strong>Jason</strong>, a man desperate to uncover the truth behind his wife's mysterious disappearance inside a remote and decaying school. What begins as a simple search spiral into a nightmarish descent through shadowed hallways, blood-soaked classrooms, and twisted alternate realities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HORROR VR EXPRIENCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built from the ground up for <strong>Virtual Reality</strong>, <i>Prenecrotic</i> delivers a deeply immersive and psychologically disturbing horror experience. Face terrifying, otherworldly creatures, gather cryptic clues, and solve environmental puzzles to uncover the school\u2019s cursed history \u2014 and the secrets it\u2019s dying to keep.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd11 <strong>Key Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VR-Only Immersion</strong><br>Every scare, every sound, every shadow \u2014 feel it all in full virtual reality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-Driven Horror</strong><br>Uncover a dark, emotional story as you piece together your wife's final steps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense Exploration &amp; Survival</strong><br>Use found tools and instinct to survive unpredictable encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reality-Bending Mechanics</strong><br>Shift between worlds using a cursed doll to unlock new paths \u2014 and new horrors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Puzzle Solving</strong><br>Decipher cryptic messages, keys, and blood-stained notes to progress deeper into the darkness.</p></li></ul>","backgrou