>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VR-Only Immersion</strong><br>Every scare, every sound, every shadow \u2014 feel it all in full virtual reality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-Driven Horror</strong><br>Uncover a dark, emotional story as you piece together your wife's final steps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense Exploration &amp; Survival</strong><br>Use found tools and instinct to survive unpredictable encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reality-Bending Mechanics</strong><br>Shift between worlds using a cursed doll to unlock new paths \u2014 and new horrors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Puzzle Solving</strong><br>Decipher cryptic messages, keys, and blood-stained notes to progress deeper into the darkness.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Elfhiem Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723640/86471e1a424ccc1dd6e5786dd3720386d792946d/header.jpg?t=1756402310","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257149642,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257149642/movie480.mp4?t=1756402308","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257149642/movie_max.mp4?t=1756402308"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257149642/fe597a26c035981366946c63d492a46ac9c008b7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756402308","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257149642/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1756402308","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257149642/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1756402308"}}],"name":"Prenecrotic: The Cursed School VR","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</s